r30/r28/r27 and reserves r31/r29 for is_type_8/target_state in the event-0xB
path.  This suggested that those two event-path locals may originally have had
function scope or an earlier declaration identity, influencing MWCC's web order.

Two bounded source variants were compiled through the canonical assigned-object
